    title: "How GPS Works — Trilateration, Constellations & WGS 84 | MyLocationLab",
    description: "In short: GPS calculates your location using radio signals from 24+ satellites via 3D trilateration, nanosecond atomic timing, and the WGS 84 coordinate datum.",
    h1: "How GPS Location Works: Satellites, Trilateration & WGS 84",
