      "A minimum of four satellites is required for a complete 3D position fix: three solve spatial dimensions (X, Y, Z) and the fourth eliminates receiver clock bias.",
      "GPS would drift by roughly 10 kilometers per day without relativistic time corrections (+38 microseconds net gain daily).",
