    pIntro1: "Whether you need to check your coordinates, calculate land altitude with our <a href='/tools/elevation-finder/'>elevation finder</a>, or calibrate receiver signal strength using our <a href='/tools/gps-accuracy/'>GPS accuracy checker</a>, your device is silently computing your place on Earth from atomic clock signals broadcast 20,200 km above.",
